  "details": "The ability to have a preset status based on what sort of instance you join (or group) may be helpful in automating how you want to present yourself.\n\nFor instance - Joining Group A's instance (Group+) would automatically change my status to \"Ask Me\" and my text to \"Occupied\". However, joining Group B's instance (Group Public) would automatically change my status to \"Available\" and \"Just relaxing\".\n\nThis can be helpful especially for folks like me who tend to host events in Group Public and change my status to Join Me with a specific text box each time - I'll admit, we do have previously used status we can easily select, but setting it to just automatically change would be convienent",
